		{
			dependencies: ["27B9C71CDEC8916F"]
			description: [
				"&eShaft&r 是 &bCreate&r 中的一个基础机械组件。一个 &eShaft&r 可用于 &o&b连接&r 两个机械组件，使一个的旋转带动另一个旋转，并且转轴是唯一可以放置 &6Mechanical Belts&r 的方块。"
				""
				"当两个机械部件通过&aShaft&r&o连接&b&r时，施加在任一部件上的&o&b旋转力&r也会以&r相同的速度&o&b传递到另一个部件。因此，如果两个部件都产生&o&b应力&r，这可能导致机器&n过度受压&r。"
				""
				"A &6Mechanical Belt&r must be placed between two &eShafts&r. The shafts must be &o&bhorizontal&r, parallel to each other, and perpendicular to the belt itself, and they must be aligned horizontally, vertically, or &o&bdiagonally&r. Please note that you &ncannot&r have any other diagonal angles other than &o&b45°&r. Additionally, no &o&bobstruction&r can exist between the two &o&bendpoints&r with the exception of other shafts."
				""
				"&a黄铜外壳&r可以放置在任何一段&6机械传送带&r上，包括包含&e传动轴&r的段落。"
