		{
			dependencies: ["60D2C64B06CE5073"]
			description: [
				"&9Mechanical Crafters&r 是一种可以&o&b自动&r合成物品的机器。"
				""
				"&a右键&r点击&9机械合成器&r的正面，并使用&c扳手&r来改变其在合成时物品输出的方向。各&9机械合成器&r仅通过此路径相连。合成器可由&3漏斗&r或&7漏斗箱&r&o&b自动填充&r。"
				""
				"On the &o&bback&r and &o&bsides&r of &9Mechanical Crafters&r, a &cWrench&r can be used to &o&bconnect&r or &o&bdisconnect&r the &einventory&r of two adjacent crafters. Crafters can &o&bshare inventories&r while not participating in the same crafting recipe. Items can also be &2inserted&r or &cremoved&r by hand."
				""
				"每个&9Mechanical Crafter&r都有一个内部齿轮，只能由相邻的&9Mechanical Crafter&r或任意大小的&2Cogwheel&r提供动力。这意味着在一个装置中，只需要&o&b1&r个&9Mechanical Crafter&r由&o&bCogwheel&r来&2供电&r。"
				""
				"当&o&b旋转力&r被激活，并且由&c红石&r供电或所有合成槽位均已填满时，&9机械合成器&r会将物品发送到相邻的合成器。要完成一个&o&b成功的&r配方，物品&o&b最终&r必须在同一个合成器中相遇。"
				""
				"Once all of the items reach the final &9Crafter&r, they will turn into the &o&bproduct&r. &9Crafters&r with &6Crafter Slot Covers&r act as &o&bempty spaces&r in a recipe; they can also be used &o&bto connect&r the &einventory&r of otherwise separate crafters. &6Crafter Slot Covers&r will not move as recipe items will."
			]
