				"&a剪贴板&r可用于&9复制&r和&e粘贴&r&o&b方块设置&r，记录&o&bSchematicannon的检查清单&r，或其他&b&b书面清单&r。"
				""
				"Use a &aClipboard&r in hand or use a placed &aClipboard&r to access its &dinterface&r. Items on the &3checklist&r can be &o&bwritten out&r or &o&bchecked off&r, or all &o&bchecked items&r can be &cerased&r."
				""
				"&b复制与粘贴&r："
				"在带有&1Value Settings&r的方块上使用&aClipboard&r来&o&b复制它们&r，例如&6Brass Funnel&r或&3Mechanical Bearing&r，然后&a左键单击&r另一个方块以&o&b粘贴它们&r。粘贴包含&0filter&r的设置时，必须在&7inventory&r中有一个&0filter&r才能&n粘贴&r该设置。"
